# New Forever dungeon. Source: foreverchanges.pro/dungeons/alcaz-prison (level range is Blizzard's). The page lists
# 5 Horde quests, takeable from level 46-48, without their givers.
@dungeon Alcaz Prison
@levels 48-53
@window 46-54
@best 49
@hub Dustwallow Marsh, 36.0, 31.0, 10
@hub Tanaris, 51.6, 27.0, 5
@hub Orgrimmar, 50.0, 50.0
@entrance none
RUN | New Forever dungeon, not checked in game yet. It is on Alcaz Island, off the north-east coast of Dustwallow Marsh. It has 5 Horde quests (from level 46 to 48), but who gives them is not published yet: ask around Brackenwall Village and take what is offered; the addon logs it so these steps can be filled in.
